# Approach 1 — HashSet

Generate every substring and put it into a set.

### Java

```java
import java.util.*;

public static int countDistinctSubstrings(String s) {

    Set<String> set = new HashSet<>();

    for (int i = 0; i < s.length(); i++) {

        for (int j = i + 1; j <= s.length(); j++) {

            set.add(s.substring(i, j));
        }
    }

    return set.size();
}
```

