# Trie — What you should remember for interviews

The important progression is:

```text
Basic Trie
    ↓
count prefix / word
    ↓
Longest word with all prefixes
    ↓
Distinct substrings
    ↓
Binary Trie
    ↓
Maximum XOR
    ↓
Maximum XOR with constraint
```

And the two most important patterns are:

### Normal Trie

```text
character
   ↓
children[character]
   ↓
next node
```

### Binary Trie

```text
bit 31
  ↓
bit 30
  ↓
...
  ↓
bit 0
```

For maximum XOR:

```text
want opposite bit
```

